Package: vmspawnd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: Virtual Machine Spawn Daemon
 vmspawnd is a daemon for managing virtual machines with
 systemd-vmspawn. Includes vmctl CLI and vmctl-tui terminal interface.

Package: vmspawnd-web
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, vmspawnd (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Web UI for vmspawnd
 Web-based management interface for vmspawnd. Provides a browser UI
 for managing virtual machines.
